  "session_event_policy": "Exact ten required keys; required-but-nullable run/command/domain-event IDs; published fixed kind and corresponding full payload; additional keys and sensitive payload keys reject. Sequence exact int>=1, duplicate event IDs and run/goal mismatches reject. Fixed closed 55-definition data projection of 3 pinned published schemas; no dynamic receipt imports or schema fetch.",
